---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/city.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cleaning Jobs With No Experience | Apply Once, No CV Needed"
  description="No cleaning experience? You can still apply. One form, no CV. Suitable applicants are trained and certified to the Spruce standard."
  path="/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/"
  ogTitle="Cleaning Jobs With No Experience | Cleaning Jobs NZ"
  ogDescription="No experience yet? Apply once. Suitable applicants are trained and certified to the Spruce standard."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Cleaning Jobs With No Experience | Cleaning Jobs NZ",
    "description": "No cleaning experience? You can still apply. One form, no CV. Suitable applicants are trained and certified to the Spruce standard before work allocation is considered.",
    "url": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/#webpage",
    "datePublished": "2026-08-22",
    "dateModified": "2026-08-22",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#website" },
    "about": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "breadcrumb": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/#breadcrumb" }
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/#breadcrumb",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Cleaning jobs with no experience", "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/" }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

  <main id="main">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <div class="wrap">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-current="page">Cleaning jobs with no experience</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">No experience</span>
        <h1>Cleaning jobs with no experience.</h1>
        <p class="lead">No cleaning experience yet? You can still apply. Experience is preferred but not always required, and &ldquo;None yet&rdquo; is an answer the application form accepts. What matters just as much is reliability, attention to detail, and willingness to follow checklists.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Apply now <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">No CV needed</span>
          <h2>One form. No CV, no cover letter.</h2>
          <p>Most job listings want a CV and a cover letter before anyone talks to you. Here, the application is a single form: your location, availability, transport, the work types that interest you, and anything you want to add in your own words. That&rsquo;s it. We review every application individually.</p>
        </div>
        <p style="max-width:760px;">You don&rsquo;t usually need qualifications to start cleaning in New Zealand either. Tahat&#363;, the government&rsquo;s career platform, notes that commercial cleaners usually <a href="https://tahatu.govt.nz/work/explore-career-ideas/occupation/T00595-commercial-cleaner" target="_blank" rel="noopener">learn on the job and usually don&rsquo;t need specific NCEA levels</a>. Depending on the work, a driver licence or a police check can be required.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">What we look for</span>
          <h2>What matters instead of experience</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="req-grid">
          <div class="req-item"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><p><strong>Reliability</strong>Turning up, on time, every time. It&rsquo;s the single thing that matters most in cleaning work.</p></div>
          <div class="req-item"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><p><strong>Attention to detail</strong>Care about the corners nobody checks. Willingness to follow checklists matters just as much as experience.</p></div>
          <div class="req-item"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><p><strong>The right to work in New Zealand</strong>Required. You&rsquo;ll confirm it in the application and it&rsquo;s verified during onboarding.</p></div>
          <div class="req-item"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><p><strong>Honesty about availability and transport</strong>Neither is a hard requirement, but knowing your real situation lets us see what work could actually suit you.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="why-split">
          <div class="why-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">Getting up to speed</span>
            <h2>Training is part of the pathway.</h2>
            <p>Suitable applicants don&rsquo;t get thrown in cold. The pathway runs from one application through review, verification, and training to the Spruce standard, before work allocation is considered. The full five stages are on <a href="/how-it-works/">the how it works page</a>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-panel">
            <div class="why-rows">
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">01</span><div><h3>Apply once</h3><p>One short form. &ldquo;None yet&rdquo; is a valid answer to the experience question.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">02</span><div><h3>Get reviewed and verified</h3><p>Every application is reviewed individually. Verification covers your right to work and basic checks.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">03</span><div><h3>Train to the Spruce standard</h3><p>Training or assessment, built around the same checklists used on every Spruce clean.</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band" id="apply-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Apply without the CV gauntlet.</h2>
        <p>Tell us your area, availability, transport, and the type of cleaning work that interests you. &ldquo;Not sure yet&rdquo; is an option too. We&rsquo;ll review your application and contact you if there&rsquo;s a suitable next step.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Start application <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note">Work is not guaranteed. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block faq-block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Starting out</span>
          <h2>Questions people ask before their first cleaning job</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do I need my own equipment?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>It depends on the type of work. Residential cleans often require basic equipment; commercial sites frequently supply their own. The specifics are covered during onboarding.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Will there be checks or references?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Verification for suitable applicants includes confirming your right to work in New Zealand and basic checks. The specifics are covered during onboarding.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Which work types suit beginners?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Tell us which types interest you, and pick &ldquo;Not sure yet&rdquo; if you genuinely aren&rsquo;t. The mix you&rsquo;re considered for depends on demand, suitability, and the training you complete.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</span>
          <h2>More ways into cleaning work</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="related-links">
          <a href="/how-to-become-a-cleaner/">How to become a cleaner in NZ</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in West Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-south-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in South Auckland</a>
          <a href="/part-time-cleaning-jobs-auckland/">Part-time cleaning jobs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
